-- @record {"chapter":"missions","data":{"constraints":"Draft storage launches nothing. IDs unique, needs internal and acyclic; choose concrete completion evidence and positive token/time limits. Start requires owner approval fingerprint for exact mission/branches.","options":["store-draft","revise"],"question":"Do tasks, prerequisites, route and acceptance checks express the requested goal?"},"key":"mission-draft","section":"judge"}
J mission-draft store-draft|revise:"Do tasks, prerequisites, route and acceptance checks express the requested goal?" -- Draft storage launches nothing. IDs unique, needs internal and acyclic; choose concrete completion evidence and positive token/time limits. Start requires owner approval fingerprint for exact mission/branches.
