-- @record {"chapter":"missions","data":{"constraints":"Pause leaves running tasks active; stop cancels selected owned runs and dependent branches. Neither changes completed evidence. Confirm exact mission/task scope before decision.","options":["pause","stop"],"question":"Pause future launches or stop owned runs?"},"key":"branch-control","section":"judge"}
J branch-control pause|stop:"Pause future launches or stop owned runs?" -- Pause leaves running tasks active; stop cancels selected owned runs and dependent branches. Neither changes completed evidence. Confirm exact mission/task scope before decision.
V J branch-control -> human:operator why:"explicit choice required"
